{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/489533-werewolf-soundtrack-ideas","id":489533,"title":"Werewolf Soundtrack Ideas","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Werewolf: The Forsaken"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-04-23T08:56:08-07:00","id":489533,"title":"Werewolf Soundtrack Ideas","content":"I'm planning on running a Werewolf game when the 2ed PoD book comes out. In the meantime, I had an interesting idea for an NPC that plays music from his iPod to placate a music spirit (his pack totem). The music tracks set the mood for specific scenes and essentially provide a real soundtrack for my game.<br /> <br /> So my question for my fellow werewolf gamers: anybody got some suggestions for good ol' werewolf music? Something to capture the Savage Fury of the Forsaken? <br /> <br /> Ambient, Metal, Grunge, Punk Rock, and Goth preferred, but I'll check out any suggestions or links to YouTube.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5700-nuwisha-nutjob","name":"Nuwisha Nutjob","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5700_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"83"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-23T09:50:02-07:00","id":489613,"title":"","content":"I'm personally a big fan of Disturbed &quot;Warrior&quot; <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=k_ZMmEFA4Q0\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=k_ZMmEFA4Q0</a> and &quot;Indestructible&quot; <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aWxBrI0g1kE\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aWxBrI0g1kE</a> are always great for when the Rahu goes to town. And &quot;The Animal&quot; <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dwxUgefMStM\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dwxUgefMStM</a> and &quot;the Night&quot; <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pCSRo_jRt10\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pCSRo_jRt10</a> are excellent for when you're on the hunt.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3347-wild-eyes","name":"Wild-Eyes","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"121"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-23T11:43:10-07:00","id":489709,"title":"","content":"Our Werewolf (the Apocalypse) campaign has done very well under Wardruna and If These Trees Could Talk. Also... Lifelover, but I couldn't tell you why.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GQA7RQEo-ss\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GQA7RQEo-ss\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GQA7RQEo-ss\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GQA7RQEo-ss </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pQSiSqCiaDM\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pQSiSqCiaDM\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pQSiSqCiaDM\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pQSiSqCiaDM </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tPKd8GEfTPI\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tPKd8GEfTPI\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tPKd8GEfTPI\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tPKd8GEfTPI </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><u>Currently running</u> (<a href=\"http://www.kpwarmerdam.nl/tabletop\" target=\"_blank\">kpwarmerdam.nl/tabletop</a>)<br /> Helion's Advocates (MtSC)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3867-warmerdutch","name":"warmerdutch","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3867_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"86"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-26T13:39:14-07:00","id":492878,"title":"","content":"My black spiral dancers theme is dangerous tonight by alice cooper.<br /> <br /> For forsaken I've found pretty successful use in lacuna coil. Mostly their older stuff (similar to what they used in the bloodlines PC game)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> WoD-Dark Eras!! (Backed for Viking Age Werewolf)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1939-lyrics-of-war","name":"Lyrics Of War","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1939_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1769"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-26T14:09:34-07:00","id":492889,"title":"","content":"If you go back through the 2e preview blogs, each blog entry has an on-theme song, together they make a pretty awesome and acclectic werewolf soundtrack. If nothing else, I'm sure you can pick and chose a few of them that suit your taste.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-26T16:10:41-07:00","id":492999,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Charlaquin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/489533-werewolf-soundtrack-ideas?p=492889#post492889\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If you go back through the 2e preview blogs, each blog entry has an on-theme song, together they make a pretty awesome and acclectic werewolf soundtrack. If nothing else, I'm sure you can pick and chose a few of them that suit your taste.</div> </div> </div> </div>Totally forgot about Stew's suggestions! Will have to go check them out <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5700-nuwisha-nutjob","name":"Nuwisha Nutjob","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5700_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"83"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-26T18:48:46-07:00","id":493114,"title":"","content":"- Vikings OST - &quot;Sacrifice&quot; (<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5h-WS1w_XB0\" target=\"_blank\">Acapella</a> and <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Mx96NA7ak5s\" target=\"_blank\">With Instruments</a>)<br /> <br /> Good for Bone Shadows, funerals, and rituals before/after pyrrhic victories.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-27T01:22:19-07:00","id":493370,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sikla Alkis</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/489533-werewolf-soundtrack-ideas?p=493114#post493114\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">- Vikings OST - &quot;Sacrifice&quot; (<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5h-WS1w_XB0\" target=\"_blank\">Acapella</a> and <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Mx96NA7ak5s\" target=\"_blank\">With Instruments</a>)<br /> <br /> Good for Bone Shadows, funerals, and rituals before/after pyrrhic victories.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I think that for Bone Shadows and rituals generally intro theme from <i>Vikings</i> - <a href=\"https://youtu.be/oqh-es7r06Y\" target=\"_blank\"><b>If I had a heart</b></a> - is better fit.<br /> <br /> Generally, <i>Disturbed</i> is great for fighting and action scenes, <i>Warduna</i> for general mystical feel. But still I do not have good theme for the Sacred Hunt, and it's now a very big part of the game. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/confused.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Confused\" smilieid=\"10\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-27T05:59:46-07:00","id":493513,"title":"","content":"I always prefer songs without lyrics to avoid distractions. So, I suggest Neofolk and Martial Indunstrial... <br /> Check some hundreds of songs here: <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://soundcloud.com/groups/martial-industrial-neofolk\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://soundcloud.com/groups/martial-industrial-neofolk\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://soundcloud.com/groups/martial-industrial-neofolk\" target=\"_blank\"> https://soundcloud.com/groups/martial-industrial-neofolk </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> a mixed bag, of course, but plenty of good stuff there.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4288-caernkeeper","name":"Caernkeeper","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-29T11:00:04-07:00","id":496436,"title":"","content":"I second that you should avoid lyrics and these are a few favorites of mine.<br /> <br /> <br /> &quot;Tribal&quot; drums<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aKb3T_VxwVo\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aKb3T_VxwVo\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aKb3T_VxwVo\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aKb3T_VxwVo </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Celtic music for those who likes it<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=06H_6oI4EK4\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=06H_6oI4EK4\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=06H_6oI4EK4\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=06H_6oI4EK4 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FK_LnOtn12c\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FK_LnOtn12c\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FK_LnOtn12c\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FK_LnOtn12c </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Wolf howls, these feels like a must to be honest, bonus if you can mix these into the other soundtracks, I know that I can't <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=L28CnhmeAD4\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=L28CnhmeAD4\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=L28CnhmeAD4\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=L28CnhmeAD4 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tNR877AHJAc\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tNR877AHJAc\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tNR877AHJAc\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tNR877AHJAc </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> General moody music, don't know for sure but I kind of like this one, except for the extra stuff they put into it...<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Sfh6XEmApjI\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Sfh6XEmApjI\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Sfh6XEmApjI\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Sfh6XEmApjI </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/970-gurkhal","name":"Gurkhal","avatar":"data:i